  ['Tracking', 'Every parcel gets a tracking link by email when the carrier scans it, usually the evening it leaves. If tracking has not moved for 3 working days, the shop opens a carrier enquiry and sends a replacement or refund if the parcel is lost.', 'tracking track where parcel late lost missing not arrived delayed'],
  ['Returns', 'Any unused item in its original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery. UK returns are free (label from Account > Orders > Return); EU customers pay return postage. Refunds go to the original payment method within 3-5 working days of the parcel reaching the warehouse.', 'return returns refund money back send back unwanted'],
  ['Exchanges', 'No direct exchanges: return the item for a refund and place a new order. Low-stock items can be held for 48 hours on request.', 'exchange swap size colour different'],
  ['Damaged or faulty items', 'Send a photo of the item and the box within 48 hours of delivery and a replacement is sent straight away, no need to return the damaged one first. Kitchen electricals carry a 2-year warranty handled by the shop.', 'damaged broken faulty dent dented cracked arrived warranty defective stopped working'],
  ['Changing or cancelling an order', 'Orders can be changed or cancelled within 1 hour of being placed. After that, use the 30-day return.', 'cancel change modify edit order address'],
  ['Payment', 'Visa, Mastercard, American Express, PayPal, Apple Pay and Google Pay. No Klarna, Clearpay or pay-later options, and no payment over the phone.', 'payment pay card paypal klarna clearpay apple google instalments'],
  ['Discount codes', 'One code per order, entered at checkout; codes cannot be added after an order is placed. First-time customers get 10% off with HELLO10. Sale items are excluded from percentage codes.', 'discount code coupon voucher promo hello10 sale'],
  ['Gift cards', 'Digital gift cards from £10 to £200 are emailed within minutes and are valid for 24 months. They can be combined with one discount code.', 'gift card voucher present'],
  ['Account and passwords', 'Password resets are self-service (Account > Forgotten password); the email arrives within 2 minutes. Guest orders can be tracked with the order number and email.', 'account password login reset sign in guest'],
  ['Wholesale and trade', 'Cafés, small hotels and independent shops can open a trade account: £250 minimum first order, 30-day terms after the second order. Wholesale enquiries are handled by a person.', 'wholesale trade bulk business cafe hotel reseller'],
  ['Price match', 'No price matching, and no refund of the difference if an item goes into the sale later.', 'price match cheaper difference sale'],
  ['Opening hours and contact', `Support is available ${SHOP.hours}. Outside those hours a person follows up the next working day.`, 'hours open contact phone email human person support time'],
];
const ORDERS = [
  { id: 'HG-10234', placed: '14 Oct 2026', items: 'Cast-iron casserole 24 cm, two linen tea towels', total: '£78.00', status: 'shipped', detail: 'Shipped 15 Oct with Royal Mail Tracked 48 (tracking RM 4471 2290 8GB); estimated delivery 17-18 Oct; last scan at the Bristol delivery office on 17 Oct, 06:40.' },
